WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
From Slack signal to approved incident record

00:04.000 --> 00:14.000
Scope the incident in Slack: choose the channels, time window and reviewer.

00:14.000 --> 00:24.000
Orchestrate a durable pipeline across collection, analysis, drafting and notification.

00:24.000 --> 00:32.000
Open a source-linked review with inspectable claims, contradictions and coverage.

00:32.000 --> 00:42.000
Inspect the evidence behind every conclusion.

00:42.000 --> 00:52.000
Keep, edit or exclude statements while preserving their sources.

00:52.000 --> 00:61.000
Resolve gaps and approve one immutable revision.

00:61.000 --> 00:68.000
Notify the team in Slack with a link to the approved record.

00:68.000 --> 00:76.000
Follow the Confluence link directly from the Slack thread.

00:76.000 --> 00:84.000
Verify that the published page matches the human-approved revision.

00:84.000 --> 00:90.000
Evidence before prose. Human approval before publication.
